@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

title USE CASE - PHÂN HỆ XÁC THỰC & TÀI KHOẢN

actor Guest
actor "Authenticated User" as User
actor Admin

rectangle "Phân hệ Auth & Account" {
  usecase "UC01 Đăng ký" as UC01
  usecase "UC02 Đăng nhập\nAccess Token JWT" as UC02
  usecase "UC03 Refresh / Logout\n[Advanced]" as UC03
  usecase "UC04 Quản lý profile" as UC04
  usecase "UC05 Đổi mật khẩu" as UC05
  usecase "UC06 Quản trị user" as UC06
  usecase "Kiểm tra JWT & RBAC" as AUTHZ
}

Guest --> UC01
Guest --> UC02
User --> UC04
User --> UC05
Admin --> UC06

UC04 ..> AUTHZ : <<include>>
UC05 ..> AUTHZ : <<include>>
UC06 ..> AUTHZ : <<include>>

note right of UC03
Advanced, không nằm trong OpenAPI MVP.
Khi bật mới dùng HttpOnly refresh cookie.
end note
@enduml
